  "question": {
    "text": "A projectile is projected at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> from horizontal with initial velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The velocity of the projectile at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> from the start will be:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ui9ei",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sdZGx",
      "text": "Zero",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cZkzn",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "UPUtC",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>The components of the velocity will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The time taken to reach maximum height is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>Hence, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>,</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">as</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>therefore</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p></blockquote>",
